.swiftpm/

# Generated from project.yml by scripts/uitest.sh. The Xcode project exists only
# to host the XCUITest bundle a Swift package cannot; committing it would mean
# keeping a second project file in step with Package.swift by hand.
CrewListrPro.xcodeproj/

# Generated from ios-project.yml by scripts/ios.sh, for the same reason — and
# so are the Info.plists and entitlements it writes beside the sources. The
# spec is where those values are declared; a committed copy is a second place
# for the bundle to disagree with the build that made it.
CrewListrProiOS.xcodeproj/
Sources/CrewListrProiOS/Info.plist
Sources/CrewListrProiOS/CrewListrPro.entitlements
Sources/CrewListrProShare/Info.plist
Sources/CrewListrProShare/CrewListrProShare.entitlements
